## utils/auth.js

### Purpose

JWT authentication se related reusable functions provide karta hai.

### Function: generateToken()

**Purpose:**  
User ke payload se JWT token generate karta hai.

**Parameters:**

| Parameter | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| payload | Object | User ki information |
| expiresIn | String | Token ki expiry |

**Returns:**  
JWT token as string.

**Example:**

generateToken({ id: user._id });

---

### Function: verifyToken()

**Purpose:**  
JWT token ko verify karta hai.

**Parameters:**

| Parameter | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| token | String | JWT token |

**Returns:**  
Decoded JWT payload.

**Throws:**  
Invalid ya expired token hone par error.